## Product-Focused Image-to-Image Search (Clothes & Accessories)

This Colab notebook builds an image-to-image product search that focuses on clothing/accessories and ignores people.

- **Detector**: OWL-ViT (open-vocabulary) to localize products (e.g., pink swimsuit, thigh chain)
- **Embedding**: OpenCLIP ViT-L/14 image encoder
- **Index**: FAISS for fast retrieval

It downloads your Drive folder, detects and crops product regions, builds an index, and retrieves similar products for any query image (even with a person in it).